          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "header",
        "bbox": [
          0.421,
          0.054,
          0.59,
          0.071
        ],
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "细胞生物学实验教程"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "bbox": [
          0.111,
          0.088,
          0.654,
          0.109
        ],
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "Triton X-100 溶液（预先煮沸），旋松瓶盖置于水浴中保温。"
          }
        ],
        "lines": [
          {
            "bbox": [
              0.12,
              0.092,
              0.645,
              0.105
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "bbox": [
          0.149,
          0.11,
          0.597,
          0.131
        ],
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "2）把瓶子从水浴中取出，旋紧盖子，剧烈摇动。"
          }
        ],
        "lines": [
          {
            "bbox": [
              0.161,
              0.113,
              0.583,
              0.126
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "bbox": [
          0.149,
          0.131,
          0.723,
          0.152
        ],
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "3）打开瓶盖，加满冰冻的 "
          },
          {
            "type": "equation_inline",
            "content": "0.4\\%"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": " NaCl和 "
          },
          {
            "type": "equation_inline",
            "content": "0.3\\%"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": " Triton X-100。"
          }
        ],
        "lines": [
          {
            "bbox": [
              0.159,
              0.134,
              0.712,
              0.148
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "bbox": [
          0.151,
          0.153,
          0.351,
          0.173
        ],
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "4）置于冰上，降温。"
          }
        ],
        "lines": [
          {
            "bbox": [
              0.159,
              0.155,
              0.344,
              0.169
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "bbox": [
          0.149,
          0.173,
          0.758,
          0.195
        ],
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "5）把溶液倒出，加等体积的庚烷和甲醇，旋转振荡以去除卵黄膜。"
          }
        ],
        "lines": [
          {
            "bbox": [
              0.161,
              0.178,
              0.747,
              0.19
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "bbox": [
          0.151,
          0.195,
          0.636,
          0.216
        ],
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "6）把瓶底的胚胎转移到新的试管，用甲醇洗涤两次。"
          }
        ],
        "lines": [
          {
            "bbox": [
              0.161,
              0.198,
              0.625,
              0.211
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "bbox": [
          0.151,
          0.216,
          0.542,
          0.237
        ],
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "7）再用甲醇孵育1h，然后进行抗体标记。"
          }
        ],
        "lines": [
          {
            "bbox": [
              0.162,
              0.22,
              0.529,
              0.233
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "bbox": [
          0.152,
          0.238,
          0.545,
          0.258
        ],
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "(3) 观察非肌肉组织肌球蛋白的固定方法。"
          }
        ],
        "lines": [
          {
            "bbox": [
              0.162,
              0.241,
              0.535,
              0.254
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "bbox": [
          0.112,
          0.259,
          0.903,
          0.3
        ],
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "1）把去绒毛膜胚胎转移到 4ml 固定液中:1 倍体积甲醛（EM 梯度）和 3 倍体积 PBS。"
          }
        ],
        "lines": [
          {
            "bbox": [
              0.161,
              0.263,
              0.894,
              0.276
            ]
          },
          {
            "bbox": [
              0.116,
              0.28,
              0.169,
              0.301
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "bbox": [
          0.151,
          0.301,
          0.448,
          0.322
        ],
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "2）旋转振荡 "
          },
          {
            "type": "equation_inline",
            "content": "45\\mathrm{s}"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "，加 "
          },
          {
            "type": "equation_inline",
            "content": "4\\mathrm{ml}"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": " 庚烷。"
          }
        ],
        "lines": [
          {
            "bbox": [
              0.162,
              0.305,
              0.44,
              0.318
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "bbox": [
          0.153,
          0.324,
          0.35,
          0.343
        ],
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "3）剧烈振荡 25min。"
          }
        ],
        "lines": [
          {
            "bbox": [
              0.161,
              0.326,
              0.341,
              0.34
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "bbox": [
          0.112,
          0.344,
          0.903,
          0.387
        ],
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "4）数次更换 PBS，置换固定液之后，用 80%~90% 的乙醇（对应前所述的鬼笔环肽）或者徒手剥离胚胎。"
          }
        ],
        "lines": [
          {
            "bbox": [
              0.161,
              0.347,
              0.895,
              0.363
            ]
          },
          {
            "bbox": [
              0.122,
              0.37,
              0.333,
              0.383
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "bbox": [
          0.154,
          0.387,
          0.303,
          0.407
        ],
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "(4) 甲醇固定。"
          }
        ],
        "lines": [
          {
            "bbox": [
              0.163,
              0.391,
              0.292,
              0.404
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "bbox": [
          0.112,
          0.408,
          0.902,
          0.45
        ],
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "1）转移脱绒毛膜胚胎到 1:1 庚烷/甲醇（97%甲醇、3% 0.5mol/L Na-EGTA, pH8.0）中。"
          }
        ],
        "lines": [
          {
            "bbox": [
              0.16,
              0.41,
              0.894,
              0.427
            ]
          },
          {
            "bbox": [
              0.12,
              0.431,
              0.232,
              0.449
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "bbox": [
          0.154,
          0.451,
          0.34,
          0.471
        ],
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "2）用力摇动 "
          },
          {
            "type": "equation_inline",
            "content": "2\\mathrm{min}"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "。"
          }
        ],
        "lines": [
          {
            "bbox": [
              0.161,
              0.454,
              0.331,
              0.468
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "bbox": [
          0.153,
          0.472,
          0.537,
          0.493
        ],
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "3）把瓶底的胚胎转移到 "
          },
          {
            "type": "equation_inline",
            "content": "1.5\\mathrm{ml}"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": " 离心管中。"
          }
        ],
        "lines": [
          {
            "bbox": [
              0.163,
              0.475,
              0.529,
              0.488
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "bbox": [
          0.154,
          0.494,
          0.333,
          0.514
        ],
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "4）甲醇洗涤3次。"
          }
        ],
        "lines": [
          {
            "bbox": [
              0.162,
              0.496,
              0.325,
              0.511
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "bbox": [
          0.154,
          0.515,
          0.368,
          0.535
        ],
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "5）甲醇 "
          },
          {
            "type": "equation_inline",
            "content": "4^{\\circ}\\mathrm{C}"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": " 固定过夜。"
          }
        ],
        "lines": [
          {
            "bbox": [
              0.163,
              0.518,
              0.359,
              0.531
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "bbox": [
          0.155,
          0.536,
          0.453,
          0.556
        ],
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "（5）用于观察GFP的固定条件。"
          }
        ],
        "lines": [
          {
            "bbox": [
              0.165,
              0.54,
              0.444,
              0.552
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "bbox": [
          0.114,
          0.558,
          0.903,
          0.601
        ],
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "如果实验目的是检测 GFP 荧光，那么胚胎暴露于甲醇或乙醇的时间要尽可能短，不要用指甲油封片，因为有机溶剂可使 GFP 荧光淬灭或严重影响其发光能力。"
          }
        ],
        "lines": [
          {
            "bbox": [
              0.163,
              0.561,
              0.894,
              0.577
            ]
          },
          {
            "bbox": [
              0.12,
              0.581,
              0.813,
              0.598
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph_title",
        "bbox": [
          0.155,
          0.61,
          0.325,
          0.633
        ],
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "（八）荧光检测"
          }
        ],
        "lines": [
          {
            "bbox": [
              0.163,
              0.611,
              0.314,
              0.63
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "bbox": [
          0.114,
          0.643,
          0.906,
          0.73
        ],
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "果蝇胚胎适用于多种共聚焦显微镜装置，正置或倒置的显微镜都可以。对于胚胎图像，果蝇实验的惯例是，一定要含有左前部以及背上部分的图像数据。为了进行横向比较，必须在同一时期同一角度，从不同胚胎个体获得相应的数据。要取得可信的结果，通常要求观察大量胚胎，并要求操作者熟悉胚胎发育的各个时段以及上下前后轴方向。"
          }
        ],
        "lines": [
          {
            "bbox": [
              0.163,
              0.645,
              0.896,
              0.66
            ]
          },
          {
            "bbox": [
              0.123,
              0.666,
              0.897,
              0.681
            ]
          },
          {
            "bbox": [
              0.122,
              0.688,
              0.895,
              0.703
            ]
          },
          {
            "bbox": [
              0.122,
              0.709,
              0.885,
              0.725
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph_title",
        "bbox": [
          0.155,
          0.738,
          0.558,
          0.761
        ],
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "（九）活体胚胎中绿色荧光蛋白的检测"
          }
        ],
        "lines": [
          {
            "bbox": [
              0.167,
              0.741,
              0.546,
              0.756
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "bbox": [
          0.157,
          0.77,
          0.222,
          0.791
        ],
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "流程:"
          }
        ],
        "lines": [
          {
            "bbox": [
              0.16,
              0.771,
              0.218,
              0.792
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "bbox": [
          0.114,
          0.793,
          0.906,
          0.835
        ],
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "(1) 对于活体胚胎的成像, 在去除绒毛膜之后用纸巾将胚胎简易吸干多余水分, 或者通过手动去除绒毛膜, 方法是用镊子将胚胎置于一张 "
          },
          {
            "type": "equation_inline",
            "content": "3 \\mathrm{~mm}"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": " 双面透明胶带上轻柔滚动。"
          }
        ],
        "lines": [
          {
            "bbox": [
              0.164,
              0.795,
              0.898,
              0.812
            ]
          },
          {
            "bbox": [
              0.123,
              0.816,
              0.855,
              0.833
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "bbox": [
          0.114,
          0.835,
          0.906,
          0.899
        ],
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "(2) 用笔刷或者镊子将卵黄膜中的胚胎转移至卤代烃油中。盖上盖玻片, 保持玻片不封闭。对于延时分析, 必须尽量让胚胎更好地接触空气, 如采用透气性的特氟龙膜显微镜载玻片。"
          }
        ],
        "lines": [
          {
            "bbox": [
              0.165,
              0.838,
              0.896,
              0.852
            ]
          },
          {
            "bbox": [
              0.123,
              0.859,
              0.897,
              0.874
            ]
          },
          {
            "bbox": [
              0.123,
              0.88,
              0.235,
              0.896
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "type": "header",
        "bbox": [
          0.415,
          0.055,
          0.599,
          0.071
        ],
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "第十二章 其他技术"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "page_number",
        "bbox": [
          0.833,
          0.057,
          0.867,
          0.071
        ],
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "241"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "bbox": [
          0.157,
          0.09,
          0.255,
          0.107
        ],
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "常见问题:"
          }
        ],
        "lines": [
          {
            "bbox": [
              0.16,
              0.09,
              0.25,
              0.107
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "bbox": [
          0.114,
          0.112,
          0.899,
          0.172
        ],
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "（1）胚胎标记失败。最常见的原因是:①固定方法不当；②去除卵黄膜效果不好；③使用不恰当的一抗或二抗；④使用错误的激发光源，使用不适当的激光都可以使偶联在二抗上的荧光染料不发光。"
          }
        ],
        "lines": [
          {
            "bbox": [
              0.161,
              0.114,
              0.893,
              0.129
            ]
          },
          {
            "bbox": [
              0.12,
              0.135,
              0.894,
              0.15
            ]
          },
          {
            "bbox": [
              0.119,
              0.155,
              0.373,
              0.172
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "bbox": [
          0.114,
          0.176,
          0.899,
          0.236
        ],
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "（2）荧光褪色。这是荧光观察的常见问题，特别在高强度激发光下以及高放大倍数下获取 Z 系列图像的时候。可在保证图像质量的前提下降低激发光强度来减少这种情况。"
          }
        ],
        "lines": [
          {
            "bbox": [
              0.161,
              0.177,
              0.894,
              0.194
            ]
          },
          {
            "bbox": [
              0.118,
              0.197,
              0.894,
              0.216
            ]
          },
          {
            "bbox": [
              0.117,
              0.218,
              0.194,
              0.236
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "bbox": [
          0.114,
          0.24,
          0.9,
          0.302
        ],
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "(3) 图像分辨率低。在共聚焦成像时就尽可能获取最高分辨率的图像。那些在已获取数据中不存在的信息不可能通过图像处理软件加进去。通常增益过大会产生高噪声，如增大光圈或增加激发光强度。样品厚度过大，聚焦不均衡都会降低分辨率。"
          }
        ],
        "lines": [
          {
            "bbox": [
              0.16,
              0.24,
              0.895,
              0.258
            ]
          },
          {
            "bbox": [
              0.118,
              0.261,
              0.893,
              0.279
            ]
          },
          {
            "bbox": [
              0.119,
              0.283,
              0.799,
              0.3
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph_title",
        "bbox": [
          0.115,
          0.311,
          0.261,
          0.333
        ],
        "content": [
          {
